OL,7,FChangelog zu Firmware 1.2.1            
OL,9,F** 1.2.1 (build 302) - 7 November 2026 
OL,10,F**                                     
OL,12,FFirmware v1.2.1 is a maintenance update
OL,13,Ffor the Commodore 64 Ultimate. It      
OL,14,Fcloses several ways of losing data on  
OL,15,Fdisk images and cartridge saves, brings
OL,16,Fback cartridges that had stopped       
OL,18,CErster Beitrag:                        
OL,20,GLiebe C64U-Freunde!                    
OL,22,GIn diesem Thread sollen die Changelogs 
OL,23,Gzu den Firmware-Updates f}r den        
OL,24,D]FForum64.de RSS feed            (1/3) 
