OL,14,GChangelog zu Firmware 1.1.0            
OL,16,G** 1.1.0 (build 165) - March 16, 2026  
OL,17,G**                                     
OL,19,GAdded ----- - Navigation: Left arrow a 
OL,20,G(top-left of C64U keyboard) will now   
OL,21,Gnavigate back a menu, in addition to   
OL,22,Gprevious controls such as WASD. - USB  
OL,23,GMouse Support: Should support most     
