OL,1,T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,Gmice. (Some proprietary USB mice may   
OL,4,Gnot work.) - The LED controller for the
OL,5,Gkeyboard and case now has Music Detect 
OL,6,Gmode, which can automatically detect   
OL,7,Gsounds and start jamming to your       
OL,8,Gfavorite SIDs and game sound effects,  
OL,9,Geven when not in "SID Music" mode. This
OL,10,Gallows you to keep the LEDs on during  
OL,11,Ggeneral usage, but have them become    
OL,12,Gsound-reactive only when applicable.   
OL,14,GChanged ------- - Improved light colors
OL,15,Gand patterns for Starlight and Founders
